{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "name": "Whitelabel LB — requests including customer domains",
  "description": "Dedicated proxy-listener request estimates for 35.202.49.152; activation required; bounded hostname breakdown.",
  "tags": ["production", "whitelabel", "load-balancers"],
  "filters": [
    {
      "id": "status",
      "name": "HTTP status class",
      "variableName": "status",
      "type": "STATIC_LIST",
      "options": ["1xx", "2xx", "3xx", "4xx", "5xx", "other"],
      "isVariableEnabled": true,
      "isBroadcastEnabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "name": "Host · selected-host panels only",
      "variableName": "host",
      "type": "PROMETHEUS_LABEL",
      "source": "Production Metrics",
      "label": "host",
      "match": "nginx_lb_http_requests_by_host_total{cluster=\"live-us-central1-cluster\",namespace=\"default\",container=\"auto-ssl-backend\",lb=\"a8c356da9198a4d53abc2169e8dadea9\"}",
      "isVariableEnabled": true,
      "isBroadcastEnabled": false
    }
  ],
  "savedFilterValues": [],
  "savedDateRange": {
    "type": "relative",
    "value": 86400
  },
  "savedRefreshInterval": 120,
  "tiles": [
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 24,
      "h": 9,
      "config": {
        "name": "Scope, variables and collection readiness",
        "displayType": "markdown",
        "source": "",
        "select": "",
        "where": "",
        "markdown": "**Selected LB: 35.202.49.152 · a8c356da9198a4d53abc2169e8dadea9.** Completed HTTP requests across whitelabel.gohighlevel.com and customer domains using this LB; includes static resources, errors and redirects. Excludes health probes, metrics/status endpoints, ACME and subrequests. This is not a count of unique users or business operations.\n\n**Collection requires the proxy instrumentation and separate Service activation PRs.** No historical backfill; enabled targets alone do not prove activation or full scrape coverage. Blank data is not zero traffic. Choose a range entirely after activation and inspect scrape gaps/exporter errors before publishing estimates.\n\n**Status** filters request panels. **Host** filters only panels named “Selected hosts”; all-host totals always include every counted domain and overflow. Named-host metrics admit 1,000 hosts per pod; further hosts are grouped into `__other_hosts__`, so an individual domain can have a partial named count. Invalid hosts use `__invalid_host__`. The top-20 graph is a changing sample, not a complete inventory.\n\nDaily average = range total ÷ (selected seconds / 86,400), including fractional days. Counters are adjusted per target before summation. Request rates use a 5-minute lookback, which can begin before the selected range. Time-series legends must visibly show **Min · Max · Last** in the deployed HyperDX renderer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "total",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 6,
      "config": {
        "name": "All hosts · selected-range requests",
        "configType": "promql",
        "displayType": "number",
        "source": "Production Metrics",
        "connection": "Production Metrics Querier",
        "promqlExpression": "sum(increase(nginx_lb_http_requests_total{cluster=\"live-us-central1-cluster\",namespace=\"default\",container=\"auto-ssl-backend\",lb=\"a8c356da9198a4d53abc2169e8dadea9\",status_class=~\"${status:regex}\"}[$__range]))",
        "legendTemplate": "",
        "fillNulls": false,
        "seriesLimit": 250,
        "numberFormat": {
          "output": "number",
          "mantissa": 2,
          "thousandSeparated": true,
          "unit": "requests"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "daily",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 9,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 6,
